 overdone.</p>\n\n<h3>Key Features:</h3>\n<ul>\n<li>\n<strong>Four-role coordination:</strong> One listing covers girl dress, mother dress, boy shirt-and-shorts set, and father shirt-and-shorts set sizes.</li>\n<li>\n<strong>Green botanical print:</strong> Ivory fabric with emerald leaf artwork creates a clean resort look that stands out in photos.</li>\n<li>\n<strong>Dress ease:</strong> Sleeveless V-neck dresses with tie waists keep the girls' and moms' side breezy and photo-ready.</li>\n<li>\n<strong>Coordinated sets:</strong> Matching shirts and shorts make the boys' and dads' outfits complete without extra styling.</li>\n<li>\n<strong>Vacation-ready comfort:</strong> Lightweight woven fabric keeps the full family look breathable for warm-weather plans.</li>\n</ul>\n\n<p>Choose each role and size you need, and build a family matching look that feels polished, breezy, and ready for the next sunny memory.</p>","tags":["Beach","Botanical Print","Boy Shirt & Shorts Set","Child 12 Years","Child 2 Years","Child 3 Years","Child 4 Years","Child 5 Years","Child 6-7 Years","Child 8 Years","Child 9-10 Years","Cream","Daddy and Me","Dress & Shirt & Shorts","Emerald Leaf","Family Matching","Father 2XL","Father 3XL","Father 4XL","Father L","Father M","Father S","Father Shirt & Shorts Set","Father XL","Four-Role Matching","Girl Dress","Green","https://detail.1688.com/offer/1039889504640.html","Ivory","Leaf Print","Matching Family Dress","Matching Family Outfits","Matching Family Set","Matching Family Shirt","Matching Family Shorts Set","Mommy and Me","Mother 2XL","Mother 3XL","Mother Dress","Mother L","Mother M","Mother S","Mother XL","Multicolor","Resort","Sets","Short Sleeve Shirt","Shorts Set","Summer","Summer Family Matching Set","V-Neck Dress","Vacation"],"seo":{"title":"Emerald Leaf Matching Set | Dress Like Mommy","description":"Green leaf family matching set with dresses plus shirt-and-shorts outfits for mom, dad, girls & boys. Sizes 2Y-12Y, Mother S-3XL, Father S-4XL.